OL,3,AInvestigations continue into fatal
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigations are continuing after a
OL,7,Fmother and three children died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire on Merseyside.
OL,10,FAnother casualty who was outside the
OL,11,Fproperty in Stone Square in Bootle,
OL,12,FSefton, when fire crews arrived during
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Tuesday was taken to
OL,14,Fhospital.
OL,16,FThe Bishop of Liverpool the Rt Rev Ruth
OL,17,FWorsley and Bishop of Warrington the Rt
OL,18,FRev Simon Robinson said they are
OL,19,F"deeply saddened to hear of the
OL,20,Fdevastating incident".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
